  "instructions": [
    "Heat 1 tablespoon of vegetable oil in a large wok or frying pan over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the ginger and garlic and sauté for 2 minutes, until fragrant.",
    "Add the rice and stir-fry for 2-3 minutes, until the rice starts to brown.",
    "Add the seasoned rice vinegar, soy sauce, hoisin sauce, scallions, ginger paste, sesame oil, salt, and black pepper. Stir-fry for 2-3 minutes, until the rice is coated with the sauce.",
    "Taste and adjust the seasoning as needed.",
    "Transfer the Shui Zhu Yu to a serving platter and serve immediately."
